    <section anchor="sect-5" numbered="true" toc="include" removeInRFC="false" pn="section-5">
      <name slugifiedName="name-changes-to-appendix-b-of-rf">RFC 6960の付録Bに対する変更</name>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-5-1">
	このセクションは、<xref target="RFC6960" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC6960"/>の付録<xref target="RFC6960" section="B.1" sectionFormat="bare" format="default" derivedLink="https://rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6960#appendix-B.1" derivedContent="RFC6960"/>および付録<xref target="RFC6960" section="B.2" sectionFormat="bare" format="default" derivedLink="https://rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6960#appendix-B.2" derivedContent="RFC6960"/>にあるOCSPのノンス拡張のASN.1定義を更新します。
	付録<xref target="RFC6960" section="B.1" sectionFormat="bare" format="default" derivedLink="https://rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6960#appendix-B.1" derivedContent="RFC6960"/>はASN.1 - 1998構文を使ってOCSPを定義しており、付録<xref target="RFC6960" section="B.2" sectionFormat="bare" format="default" derivedLink="https://rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6960#appendix-B.2" derivedContent="RFC6960"/>はASN.1 - 2008構文を使ってOCSPを定義しています。</t>
      <section anchor="sect-5-1" numbered="true" toc="include" removeInRFC="false" pn="section-5.1">
        <name slugifiedName="name-changes-to-appendix-b1-ocsp">付録B.1「OCSP in ASN.1 - 1998 Syntax」に対する変更</name>
        <t indent="0" pn="section-5.1-1">旧構文: </t>
        <t indent="0" pn="section-5.1-2">ASN.1 - 1998構文については、<xref target="RFC6960" sectionFormat="of" section="B.1" format="default" derivedLink="https://rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6960#appendix-B.1" derivedContent="RFC6960"/>にOCSPのノンス拡張の定義はありません。</t>
        <t indent="0" pn="section-5.1-3">新構文: </t>
        <sourcecode type="asn.1" markers="false" pn="section-5.1-4">
    Nonce ::= OCTET STRING(SIZE(1..32))
</sourcecode>
      </section>
      <section anchor="sect-5-2" numbered="true" toc="include" removeInRFC="false" pn="section-5.2">
        <name slugifiedName="name-changes-to-appendix-b2-ocsp">付録B.2「OCSP in ASN.1 - 2008 Syntax」に対する変更</name>
        <t indent="0" pn="section-5.2-1">旧構文: </t>
        <sourcecode type="asn.1" markers="false" pn="section-5.2-2">
    re-ocsp-nonce EXTENSION ::= { SYNTAX OCTET STRING IDENTIFIED
        BY id-pkix-ocsp-nonce }
</sourcecode>
        <t indent="0" pn="section-5.2-3">新構文: </t>
        <sourcecode type="asn.1" markers="false" pn="section-5.2-4">
    re-ocsp-nonce EXTENSION ::= { SYNTAX OCTET STRING(SIZE(1..32))
        IDENTIFIED BY id-pkix-ocsp-nonce }
</sourcecode>
      </section>
    </section>
  </middle>
